#AREA Olympus~
#AUTHORS Generic~





#HELPS
-1 OLYMPUS~
 This is the haven of the great Greek gods and Godesses. There are many 
mysterious and magical wonders here. Beware of the gods of war though, because
they may be tougher than you think. 

Revamped by Haxl (03/03/97)
"Adjusted" by Grimace (04/22/97)
"Adjusted" again by Emperor (30/11/97)
~

0 $~




#RANGES 5 30 0 99
#MOBILES
#901
zeus god~
Zeus~
Zeus sits here on a throne.~
You see before you the greatest of the Olympians.  It seems as if he could
destroy you with a thought.  Every glance penetrates deep into your soul.
You now know what true fear is. Maybe instead of fighting him you should
seek the aid of the gods.~
ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_PROTECT_EVIL|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
1000 S
35 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 35d35+1000 1d35+9
28713 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if ispc($n)
   if quest(2,2,$n) == 0
      say Greetings mortal
      say What do you seek here?
   endif
enduf
~
>speech_prog p I seek the aid of the gods.~
say Well at the moment I am quite busy, but you can go look ask Hera for help.
say Tell her I sent you.
mpmset $n quest 2 2 1
~
>death_prog 100~
if level($n) > 40
   mpechoat $n You should kill something your level!
   mppurge $i
endif
~
|
